    {
      "append_text": "\n## Output Verification Guard\n\nAfter saving `output.xlsx`, reload it with `load_workbook(\"output.xlsx\", data_only=True)` and verify the exact target cells contain the intended final values before stopping. If verification fails, fix the output and save it again before completion.\n",
